      "content": "stop playing the game entirely... that's what it feels like. like the only way to actually win or at least stop losing is to just walk away from the table for good. i'm just so tired of the fighting and the pretending. if everything is already gone, what's there left to actually protect or hold onto? it just feels like the logic of the whole thing is broken.",
